    neo:h2 "Day-to-Day"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "SPEAKING MINDFULLY"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "23bf01081890ae02c13cf86408a79d1e"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 3 ;
    neo:sentence_number 4 ;
    neo:text "It's difficult to practice being mindful when speaking and seeing."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_2181 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_1020,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_109,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_16,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_2148,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_2180,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_2182,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_345 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "Day-to-Day"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "SPEAKING MINDFULLY"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "1d5d1867ed3cc1c467d1330e1db40559"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 3 ;
    neo:sentence_number 5 ;
    neo:text "The reasons are that we don't practice being mindful when speaking, seeing, and looking and we also don't have enough momentum in our awareness."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_2183 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_175,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_345,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_36,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_803,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_85,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_974 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "Day-to-Day"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "SPEAKING MINDFULLY"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "97123e7fc4a610a21b068c5d80a0984d"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 3 ;
    neo:sentence_number 6 ;
    neo:text "The whole point of my retreats is that I'm teaching you a skill that you're supposed to bring into your life, and use in your life, so that mindfulness becomes a way of life."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_2184 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_2148,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_345,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_73,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_74 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "Day-to-Day"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "SPEAKING MINDFULLY"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "19f47132122709dc1f88c16a122408cb"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 3 ;
    neo:sentence_number 7 ;
    neo:text "That's why I think it is useful to know and practice being mindful when you speak, especially when you are back home and at work."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_2185 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_2148,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_2186,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_345 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "Day-to-Day"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "SPEAKING MINDFULLY"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "6d7412cefe23b0cdfc40b0ab0b7e3282"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 4 ;
    neo:sentence_number 1 ;
    neo:text "Awareness of speech is not a strange or wonderful thing but something very simple: be mindful when you speak."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_2187 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_16,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_741 ;
