    neo:sentence_number 9 ;
    neo:text "By day three I had a headache but I didn't give up."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_444 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_36,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_445,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_446,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_447,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_448 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "a9ca90b46a7ec9e0598ee16e2653bbc2"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 8 ;
    neo:sentence_number 10 ;
    neo:text "I put medicated plasters that relieve muscle soreness at my temples and continued my efforts, until finally it got too much and too painful, that I gave up."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_449 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_36 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "11caf911a4f49a6139f2fcef24856da1"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 8 ;
    neo:sentence_number 11 ;
    neo:text "I surrendered."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_450 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_36,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_423 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "a1360d959891ad5cfc7eb20635157236"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 8 ;
    neo:sentence_number 12 ;
    neo:text "Never mind if I couldn't have that bliss back, I thought."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_451 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_36,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_407,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_423 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "afa29578b775982f2fa2c762f924a4b6"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 8 ;
    neo:sentence_number 13 ;
    neo:text "I just dropped it and continued to meditate without any more desire to achieve that bliss."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_452 a neo:Document ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "a8f7c0912ddf745d9bfb587f5615b956"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 8 ;
    neo:sentence_number 14 ;
    neo:text "It came back, just like that."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_453 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_36,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_423 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "7ac2f42393c60cbf7658c43ad0941e6f"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 8 ;
    neo:sentence_number 15 ;
    neo:text "As I simply paid attention to what I was doing, without a thought of having any more of the bliss, it was back."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_454 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_23,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_326,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_36,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_412,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_455 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "d972f798c84d332e602620ce1bac9280"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 8 ;
    neo:sentence_number 16 ;
    neo:text "And I learned this huge lesson about meditation, which has stayed with me ever since, and I ran all the way to my teacher's kuti (cottage) to tell him and he hammered home the bitter lesson, saying, \"Well if you can get it by doing it, then do it.\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_456 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_120,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_163,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_23,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_36 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "87e7852388bbd54bc37a5a9934fbc966"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 9 ;
    neo:sentence_number 1 ;
    neo:text "I didn't know the mind directly then, but I just realized very deeply that greed was neither useful nor helpful when practicing meditation."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_457 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_407,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_458 ;
