    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "0a1e18c788e0e56e4ecab8843c7d5148"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 9 ;
    neo:sentence_number 2 ;
    neo:text "It had no place in getting me results."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_459 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_163,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_36,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_460 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "4c8ae7068841c91dde0f85a8932ed354"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 9 ;
    neo:sentence_number 3 ;
    neo:text "So I never had greed when I meditated anymore."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_461 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_163,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_36,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_462 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "9dc7ac1eb014eb798903fb042d4afb4e"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 9 ;
    neo:sentence_number 4 ;
    neo:text "Ironically that did not prevent me from having greed in many other aspects of my life, so much so that it led to depression."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_463 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_244,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_325,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_36,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_464,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_85 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "b35a199356fc3fa2f2f2e7dc1b033914"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 10 ;
    neo:sentence_number 1 ;
    neo:text "When I was around 18 to 20 years old on one of my retreats with my teacher, I remember Sayadawgyi mentioning that we can ask what the mind is aware of."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_465 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_309,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_36,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_466,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_467,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_85 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "be249bfa0218fe23429472073b6e2979"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 10 ;
    neo:sentence_number 2 ;
    neo:text "Until then, in all my retreats over the years, although I was totally dedicated to being mindful on retreat, I simply watched my body movements and sensations."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_468 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_309,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_312,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_36,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_469,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_470 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "faea7822a77fbe94daddb102fb5da5a7"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 10 ;
    neo:sentence_number 3 ;
    neo:text "When thoughts were noticed, I acknowledged them then returned to the task of being aware of all my bodily movements and sensations, over and over again all day long."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_471 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_115,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_120,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_326,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_36,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_437,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_472,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_473,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_474 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "313fb971789876f7a883dcf40b86f264"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 10 ;
    neo:sentence_number 4 ;
    neo:text "I recalled my teacher's words the next morning as I was brushing my teeth and when I posed the question, it felt like a weight was suddenly taken off my mind."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_475 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_109,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_244,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_476,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_477,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_478 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "62d4788d9e02cca9731fb58bb06e3370"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 10 ;
    neo:sentence_number 5 ;
    neo:text "As it was, my practice had built up quite a bit of momentum on the retreat so when the attention turned to what the mind was aware of, and what the mind knew, there was suddenly so much to know!"^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_479 a neo:Document ;
