        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_500,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_506,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_507 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "284947fc92dd236d037606051f996a4e"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 11 ;
    neo:sentence_number 4 ;
    neo:text "My father decided to take me out of University, no doubt a fact that I was a non-doctor in a family filled with brothers and a sister studying medicine."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_508 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_492,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_500,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_509,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_510 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "fb59c7ad619c4e3cd01668561306dc58"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 11 ;
    neo:sentence_number 5 ;
    neo:text "The only other brother not studying medicine had already finished University and was helping my father with the shop."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_511 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_36,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_490,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_492,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_512 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "1c6f84b06a733cde25bca73476cff7a5"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 12 ;
    neo:sentence_number 1 ;
    neo:text "I wanted so much to continue to be with my friends that I actually, while helping out at the shop, still tried to repeat my second year at University on my own."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_513 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_493,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_494,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_514 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "fe1b5858c47b8c3bb8a9386d6d66083a"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 12 ;
    neo:sentence_number 2 ;
    neo:text "It was not as much fun anymore by then because all my friends had already moved on to the main Rangoon University for their third year in Engineering studies while I was still at the Regional College."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_515 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_36,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_516 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "8b203ac5c31d47b003abbc6fd2310e2d"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 12 ;
    neo:sentence_number 3 ;
    neo:text "It was discouraging, so I stopped trying to repeat the year."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_517 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_36,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_462,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_518,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_519,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_520 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "c3b7ca0ea196b8ceb41e0917c94add89"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 12 ;
    neo:sentence_number 4 ;
    neo:text "I slowly descended into depression from resentment, fear, dissatisfaction, having to do what I did not want to, and not being able to do what I wanted to do."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_521 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_163,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_462,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_522,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_523,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_524 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "dd0c59bfa8697fddb5287cc71af8eff9"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 12 ;
    neo:sentence_number 5 ;
    neo:text "It was the love, or actually greed for fun that indirectly led to my years of depression."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_525 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_36,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_462,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_526 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "3bfeb4d52d43f0a155c0781659ecfbea"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 13 ;
    neo:sentence_number 1 ;
    neo:text "Initially I forgot about my unhappiness after a while, because it wasn't very strong then and the depression seemed to go away."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_527 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_36,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_528 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "96aedf9d70f762a653749c7bd8979af7"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 13 ;
    neo:sentence_number 2 ;
    neo:text "When it returned a second time, I got fed up of feeling mopey and angrily railed against the emotion and willed myself to overcome it that way."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_529 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_326,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_36,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_530,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_531,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_72 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "31b82c722dd5f5587a5094179bbe3269"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 14 ;
    neo:sentence_number 1 ;
    neo:text "While I was working with my father, I got more of an opportunity to go for longer retreats at my teacher's monastery too, than when I had been in school."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_532 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_36,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_500,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_533 ;
