        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_734,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_735 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "ce2778fce024e346e86c3817e2ccb805"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 22 ;
    neo:sentence_number 8 ;
    neo:text "And the conviction that it gave the mind provided me with the motivation to continue practicing with increased vigor."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_736 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_338,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_36,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_371,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_47,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_737 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "ef0d06a7aac499adab8f5c5082cf4d8b"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 22 ;
    neo:sentence_number 9 ;
    neo:text "I knew now that this was the way out, for sure, so there was a real desire to practice."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_738 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_36,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_47,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_739 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "f26ce77b3d123c856495342a6b18fa39"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 22 ;
    neo:sentence_number 10 ;
    neo:text "I began to think about practice daily, about how to practice."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_740 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_36,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_462,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_73,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_741,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_742 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "89528ffdea8e1fe6df150b92457141b0"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 23 ;
    neo:sentence_number 1 ;
    neo:text "After about six months practicing at home, the depression had gradually disappeared and I began to notice that I would notice my reactions whenever I looked at people or when I heard something."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_743 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_312,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_359,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_36,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_47,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_544,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_659,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_744,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_745 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "977d8e6fc57c24d145dd633e4f773e5a"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 23 ;
    neo:sentence_number 2 ;
    neo:text "The thoughts and feelings had calmed down enough and the practice had gained enough momentum that I finally had the mental space and interest to use objects outside of the breath or feelings."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_746 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_120,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_47,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_512,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_673,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_747,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_748,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_749,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_750,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_751 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "3481ac6a1a463813857f1de654b3c9fc"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 23 ;
    neo:sentence_number 3 ;
    neo:text "The practice became interesting in and of itself, and I began initially just one at a time to explore the mind's ability to stay anchored, for example on one pair of fingertips touching while sitting in the shop, on myself when drinking coffee or tea during a break, or being aware of seeing while waiting for customers, and so on."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_75 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_76,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_77,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_78 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "Dear Reader"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "0d4a17a61951fe564ffe54706a6265fa"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 3 ;
    neo:sentence_number 2 ;
    neo:text "When his long- time disciples make the migration to the Shwe Oo Min Dhamma Sukha Tawya Meditation Center in Yangon, Myanmar, one of his first questions is typically about their practice."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_752 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_36,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_753,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_754,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_755,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_756,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_757,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_758 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "8cf5d6c622c23f12e981b00f2884ec2e"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 24 ;
    neo:sentence_number 1 ;
    neo:text "And these accumulated practices of collecting the mind enabled me to then be more aware of the interactions within my own mind when I was making decisions, counting money or attending to customers."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_759 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_120,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_36,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_47,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_760,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_761 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "d0aa1c892a9420f791a9c675c2a858d1"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 24 ;
    neo:sentence_number 2 ;
    neo:text "I could notice when I lost my composure and devise a plan for maintaining it in my next interaction, always using the practice of collecting the mind as the basis for strengthening the mind's composure."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_762 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_16,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_259,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_469,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_751,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_763,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_764,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_765,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_766 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "6fe092fb6d482e72b98c4652822b22cc"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 24 ;
    neo:sentence_number 3 ;
    neo:text "As these interactions happened daily and routinely, this is how I learned what helped me to maintain the composure of my mind, what helped me to remain aware and maintain continuity--when I needed to pick up attention on one object, mainly when I was no longer interacting with someone else or doing a task and when I needed to be aware in a more fluid way as in when customers approached and I had to attend to them and interact with them."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_767 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_16,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_381,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_768 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "22a60f9f93a0699285bc3b703d7877cd"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 24 ;
    neo:sentence_number 4 ;
    neo:text "The awareness became closer to continuous and insights naturally arose more and more over time."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_769 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_770,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_771,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_772,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_773,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_774 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "ec1cc964ce63e739d975a82158bf1fcd"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 25 ;
    neo:sentence_number 1 ;
    neo:text "A year in, I read an article about the ajivatthamaka sila, eight precepts with right livelihood as the eighth precept."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_775 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_776,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_777,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_778,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_779,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_780,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_781 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "b981ffc88434d6dee170196003bceadf"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 25 ;
    neo:sentence_number 2 ;
    neo:text "I was particularly interested in the expansion of the precept on not telling untruths, into four precepts for right speech: refraining from telling lies, slander, harsh speech, and idle chatter."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_782 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_36 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "f6b4a1d9cfcac4bea571ab5d1760b2b9"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 25 ;
    neo:sentence_number 3 ;
    neo:text "I was inspired to try this."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_783 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_462,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_784,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_785 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "1e34ddf26b9d39d4cece86b5045c9f63"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 25 ;
    neo:sentence_number 4 ;
    neo:text "The depression had already made me quite subdued at the marketplace I worked at, compared to the joker I had been previously, and then practicing continuously made me quieter."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_786 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_781,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_787 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "b845848b96600cddf55aa587e6256432"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 26 ;
    neo:sentence_number 1 ;
    neo:text "However, taking on the four right speech precepts left me with hardly anything to say because I now avoided idle chatter."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_788 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_343,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_789,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_790 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "b591286c5e5f2243c5a3fde6497787fa"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 26 ;
    neo:sentence_number 2 ;
    neo:text "If someone came over to gossip about some other stallholder, they no longer found in me someone that sympathized."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_79 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_47,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_80,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_81 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "Dear Reader"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "8322acbfffd92df3ba265f7eb6ec367d"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 3 ;
    neo:sentence_number 3 ;
    neo:text "Some may reply in detail while others sheepishly answer that they have returned to jumpstart their flagging practice."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_791 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_36,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_654 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "2e60cd6d4f57a793ecc259563dfa8422"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 26 ;
    neo:sentence_number 3 ;
    neo:text "I merely listened and did not contribute as I saw neither wisdom nor meaning in adding fuel to their fire."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_792 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_120,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_345,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_760,
        ex:node_4_4b1e9561_d146_4421_8669_7c384dd27495_793 ;
